# Strip .html extension with a 301 permanent redirect
# (so Google drops the old .html URLs from its index)
#
# NOTE: domain-level sources (e.g. https://www.example.com/*) are NOT supported
# in Cloudflare Pages _redirects. The www -> non-www redirect is handled by a
# Cloudflare Page Rule at the edge instead, which runs before Pages.
/*.html  /:splat  301
